The Wildfire Tracker: Be aware of every wildfire around the world with an all-in-one weather tracker right on your device.

The Wildfire Tracker app is an essential tool for anyone living in high-risk wildfire areas or planning to travel to such areas. It provides real-time updates on wildfire hotspots, their behavior, and timely push notifications to help users make informed decisions and stay safe.


KEEP YOURSELF SAFE:

- See all the active hotspots and wildfires on the interactive map with all the details you might need;

- Read weather alerts with all the details you might need;

- Receive push notifications whenever there’s a wildfire alert for the bookmarked location.

- Choose background maps (standard, hybrid, satellite), search locations, add them to bookmarks and stay out of harm’s way.


VIEW WEATHER DETAILS:

- 24-hour and 7-day forecast;

- Current, today’s min & max and "Feels Like" temperature;

- Pressure, humidity, wind speed, visibility, dew point info;

- Chance of Precipitation;


Get The Wildfire Tracker Premium:

- Severe weather alerts for all saved locations

- Wildfire tracking

- Hourly forecast

- 14-day forecast

- No ads


